  "description": "CAR101 Tyre & Trim Restorer | 250ml - Pack of 1|... - Distributed/Packaged by Car101. Product Details: CAR101 Tyre & Trim Restorer | 250ml - Pack of 1|... - Distributed/Packaged by Car101. Product Details: CAR101 Tyre & Trim Restorer | 250ml - Pack of 1| Multi-Purpose Protectant for Plastic, Vinyl & Rubber | Nano Polymers | Revives Faded Exterior Trim & Bumpers | Restores Shine & Prevents Fading - Distributed/Packaged by Car101. Product Details: MULTI-PURPOSE FORMULA: Advanced restorer designed for tyres, trim, and other automotive surfaces made of plastic, vinyl, and rubber components NANO POLYMER TECHNOLOGY: Utilises cutting-edge nano polymers to penetrate deep into surfaces, preventing material degradation and cracking UV PROTECTION: Provides superior protection against harmful ultraviolet rays, helping maintain the restored appearance for longer periods HYDROPHOBIC COATING: Creates a water-repelling barrier that helps keep surfaces clean and maintains their restored appearance DARKENING EFFECT: Effectively restores and enhances the deep black finish of faded automotive surfaces, giving them a fresh, new appearance Clean & Dry: Ensure the surface is free from dirt and moisture. Shake Well: Give the can a thorough shake before spraying. Spray Evenly: Hold 6–8 inches away and apply a light, uniform coat. Wipe Off Excess: Use a clean cloth to remove any overspray or buildup. Allow to Dry: Let it settle for a few minutes to form a durable, protective layer. Upgrade your car care routine with CAR101 “Unlock Code Black” and experience the power of India’s first DIY Nano Polymer Coating for tyres and trims!",
